      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A simple thing you can do now is put a fixed joint component on your gameobject without a connected rigid body. Just set drag to 0 and turn of gravity and it will stay wherever your activate the game object. It's a little jittery though if you move around a lot.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
